z=1C1FKPE_pt-PTBR1105BR1105&amp;oq=empresa+apta+a+exportar&amp;gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUyBggAEEUYOdIBCDM4NDVqMGo0qAIAsAIA&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;mstk=AUtExfBpx4P9FzalwYI2cZG_zyZUaIs1dRlz1Uf2A0seRm5MLwaoeYLAZutjhMAJd1SrKilHiPH9QwnWTKU7kPb_JiUdufa5sCianmS5vJcvM5mkHpPgL0AI8yqMlPHv2cux42hKzL9YqMPRyXOfzFGVW1TZ_wvbLFS9Hul7BnqSqz755Zy1oe8ZdvmmdZc6gQ94dMpkKE9s3HWczowoOg842K2ZR9Kim2Chb3EdbAdDLnS92qfxnXSR72SNJL7tjAPdfv0Ncoc_cT9j_EODcIm3k2D8&amp;csui=3&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjMo4XS-vaRAxWfpJUCHWeMEkYQgK4QegQIARAD\">RADAR da Receita Federal</a> </strong>(que habilita ao acesso ao Siscomex) e tem a documentação necessária para atuar no comércio exterior, como o CNPJ, contrato social e regularidade tributária, atenta as exigências legais para acessar mercados internacionais de forma segura e lucrativa.</p>		\n					<h2>Não deixe para depois</h2>				\n							<a href=\"https://maquinas.umaprevia.com.br/formulario/\" id=\"\">\n					ORÇAMENTO				</a>\n					<h3>Solicite agora mesmo um orçamento</h3>','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-06-01 19:11:42','2026-06-01 19:11:42','',0,'https://maquinas.umaprevia.com.br/home/',0,'page','',0),(985,1,'2019-05-31 07:38:11','2019-05-31 07:38:11','','astra','','publish','closed','closed','','astra-2-3','','','2019-05-31 07:38:11','2019-05-31 07:38:11','',0,'https://maquinas.umaprevia.com.br/2019/05/31/astra-2-3/',0,'custom_css','',0),(1461,1,'2019-06-06 07:02:17','2019-06-06 07:02:17','','astra','','publish','closed','closed','','astra-2-4','','','2019-06-06 07:02:17','2019-06-06 07:02:17','',0,'https://maquinas.umaprevia.com.br/2019/06/06/astra-2-4/',0,'custom_css','',0),(3049,1,'2020-02-17 04:44:40','2020-02-17 04:44:40','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2023-10-26 22:02:45','2023-10-26 22:02:45','',0,'https://maquinas.umaprevia.com.br/?elementor_library=default-kit',0,'elementor_library','',0),(4256,1,'2021-03-15 04:40:04','2021-03-15 04:40:04','','woocommerce-placeholder','','inherit